  "prefLabel": "Tax 212.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 212.01 Applicability. This part, as well as Tax 201, shall apply to appeals of residences located in an industrial or commercial zone under RSA 75:14, or reclassification under RSA 75:16.\n\nSource. #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 216.01); ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
